{"tool_name":"quickfit-3","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p><span>QuickFit 3 is a data evaluation software for FCS Fluorescence Correlation Spectroscopy and imagingFCS (imFCS) measurements, developed in the group B040 (Prof. J\u00f6rg Langowski) at the German Cancer Research Center (DKFZ). Actually QuickFit 3 itself is a project manager and all functionality is added as plugins. A set of tested plugins for FCS, imagingFCS and some microscopy-related image processing tasks is supplied together with the software.</span></p>","summary":"","value":"<p><span>QuickFit 3 is a data evaluation software for FCS Fluorescence Correlation Spectroscopy and imagingFCS (imFCS) measurements, developed in the group B040 (Prof. J\u00f6rg Langowski) at the German Cancer Research Center (DKFZ). Actually QuickFit 3 itself is a project manager and all functionality is added as plugins. A set of tested plugins for FCS, imagingFCS and some microscopy-related image processing tasks is supplied together with the software.</span></p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2020-10-19T15:10:24+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2019-11-22T04:51:24+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"JW. Krieger, J. Langowski (2015): QuickFit 3.0 (status: beta, compiled: ???, SVN: ???): A data evaluation application for biophysics, [web page] <a href=\"http://www.dkfz.de/Macromol/quickfit/\">http://www.dkfz.de/Macromol/quickfit/</a> [Accessed on ???]","value":"JW. Krieger, J. Langowski (2015): QuickFit 3.0 (status: beta, compiled: ???, SVN: ???): A data evaluation application for biophysics, [web page] http://www.dkfz.de/Macromol/quickfit/ [Accessed on ???] "}],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1574399236,"last_comment_uid":1,"statu